  "notes": "Population/households are final ENUMERATED counts (census moment 00:00 15 June 2022, incl. floating population), not PEC-adjusted. Unit lists and population per district/upazila/city corporation/thana/paurashava/union/ward from the Community Report Excel files, sheet C-01 (BBS 2022 geocodes; code_scheme BBS_GEOCODE_2022 = C-01 code columns joined with '-', prefixed by division 55). Administrative-unit counts, area and density from the District Report Key Findings tables (District Series, June 2024) and Union Statistics (June 2025) Table D01. basis: enumerated | as stated (printed in a BBS table) | derived (counted from the C-01 geocode rows). Level 'cantonment' is used for Saidpur Cantonment (Union/Ward column, code 998, under Saidpur) and for the 'Cantonment' row (code 998) of Rangpur City Corporation's Kotwali Thana. Large PDFs/Excel are not committed; fetch.py --division rangpur re-downloads them (bbs.gov.bd needs the Sectigo DV R36 intermediate, added at runtime from its AIA URL).",
